  "details": "A component that synchronizes the Transform of a GameObject under an avatar with remote players including a late joiner. It's like an avatar version of VRC_ObjectSync for World.\n\nIt seems that official support for world constraints will appear in VRC Constraint, so that may cover it but anyway. I would like it to work not only for static objects, but also for objects that are moving due to animations, etc. (even if the low synchronization late for performance).",
